{"kind":"grammar","lang":"en","entities":{"n5-920":{"renderings":[{"id":"ad9df78a55125fc2","role":"label","field":"name","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n5-920"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"Negative て-form"},{"id":"b3ab973945fdbe98","role":"prose","field":"shortExplanation","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n5-920"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"The negative て-form of an い-adjective, for joining and giving reasons."},{"id":"7e147449a6c5d413","role":"prose","field":"longExplanation","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n5-920"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"The negative くない conjugates like an い-adjective, so its て-form is くなくて (安くなくて、買わなかった, 'it wasn't cheap, so I didn't buy it')."},{"id":"dc4fde5633665d4f","role":"prose","field":"formation","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n5-920"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"Drop the final い and add くなくて: 高い -> 高くなくて. Irregular: いい -> よくなくて."},{"id":"2e72206fc38c2c13","role":"label","field":"derives","source":{"source":"gokan","ref":"n5-920"},"match":"id","status":"reviewed","value":"negative て-form (くなくて)"}]}}}